    "updated_at": "2022-05-03T03:38:06Z",
    "body": "I wonder if starship isn't receiving the SIGINT at all. Testing it on my system (by putting `loop{}` at the top of main, then trying to deal with the resulting mess) shows that starship appears to respond to SIGINTs as expected, by dying.\r\n\r\nI wonder if there's something going on where starship is not considered to be in the foreground by the shell, so the SIGINT is not appropriately delivered.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
